    practice:
      'For one week, notice when you\'re blaming — "I returned to use because..." "I\'m struggling because..." Every time you catch yourself blaming, reframe it: "What do I do next? What action can I take right now?" This isn\'t about beating yourself up. It\'s about reclaiming your power.',
